                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "if": "{{(user?.data?.has_password ?? _global.currentUser?.has_password) === false && (user?.data?.email_deliverable ?? _global.currentUser?.email_deliverable) === false && !_local?.reauthChallengeId}}",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "space-y-5"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "P",
                            "if": "{{_local?.reauthError}}",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "text-sm text-red-600 dark:text-red-400",
                                "role": "alert"
                            },
                            "text": "{{_local?.reauthError ?? ''}}"
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "reauth_continue_button",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Button",
                            "actions": [
                                {
                                    "comment": "본인 확인 계속하기 — 위 칸의 「인증번호 받기」와 같은 요청(수단 비움, 서버가 고름). 외부 수단이면 그 화면으로 갔다가 확인 토큰을 들고\n                 돌아오고, 인증번호 수단이면 번호 칸을 연다(어디로 보냈는지는 수단마다 달라 「보냈습니다」 로만 알린다).",
                                    "type": "click",
                                    "handler": "sequence",
                                    "actions": [
                                        {
                                            "handler": "setState",
                                            "params": {
                                                "target": "local",
                                                "isRequestingReauthCode": true,
                                                "reauthError": null
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "handler": "apiCall",
                                            "target": "/api/identity/challenges",
                                            "auth_required": true,
                                            "params": {
                                                "method": "POST",
                                                "body": {
                                                    "purpose": "sensitive_action",
                                                    "return_path": "/mypage/profile/edit"
                                                }
                                            },
                                            "onSuccess": [
                                                {
                                                    "handler": "redirect",
                                                    "if": "{{response.data?.render_hint === 'external_redirect' && !!response.data?.redirect_url}}",
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "url": "{{response.data.redirect_url}}"
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "handler": "setState",
                                                    "if": "{{response.data?.render_hint === 'external_redirect' && !response.data?.redirect_url}}",
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "target": "local",
                                                        "isRequestingReauthCode": false,
                                                        "reauthError": "{{$t('mypage.profile.reauth_external_failed')}}"
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "handler": "setState",
                                                    "if": "{{response.data?.render_hint !== 'external_redirect'}}",
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "target": "local",
                                                        "isRequestingReauthCode": false,
                                                        "reauthChallengeId": "{{response.data?.id}}",
                                                        "reauthExpiresAt": "{{response.data?.expires_at}}",
                                                        "reauthCode": ""
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "handler": "toast",
                                                    "if": "{{response.data?.render_hint !== 'external_redirect'}}",
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "type": "info",
                                                        "message": "$t:mypage.profile.reauth_code_sent_generic"
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            ],
                                            "onError": {
                                                "handler": "setState",
                                                "params": {
                                                    "target": "local",
                                                    "isRequestingReauthCode": false,
                                                    "reauthError": "{{error.message}}"
                                                }
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ],
                            "props": {
                                "type": "button",
                                "className": "w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-4 py-2.5 bg-gray-900 dark:bg-white text-white dark:text-gray-900 rounded-lg font-medium hover:bg-gray-800 dark:hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed cursor-pointer",
                                "disabled": "{{_local?.isRequestingReauthCode ?? false}}"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Icon",
                                    "if": "{{_local?.isRequestingReauthCode}}",
                                    "props": {
                                        "name": "spinner",
                                        "size": "sm"
                                    }
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "text": "$t:mypage.profile.reauth_continue"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "mypage_reauth_methods_slot",
                            "type": "extension_point",
                            "name": "mypage_reauth_methods",
                            "default": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "P",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "p-3 rounded-lg bg-yellow-50 dark:bg-yellow-900/20 border border-yellow-200 dark:border-yellow-800 text-sm text-yellow-800 dark:text-yellow-300",
                                        "role": "status"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:mypage.profile.reauth_unavailable"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "A",
                            "actions": [
                                {
                                    "type": "click",
                                    "handler": "navigate"
                                }
                            ],
                            "props": {
                                "href": "/mypage/profile",
                                "className": "inline-flex items-center justify-center w-full px-4 py-2.5 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 hover:underline cursor-pointer"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:common.cancel"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
